    "heading": "Consequences",
    "lineStart": 486,
    "lineEnd": 488
  },
  "section": "7.7",
  "rulesText": "When a PC suffers an effect from an enemy or a dangerous situation, it's called a **consequence**. Consequences are the companion to effects. PCs have effect on the world around them and they suffer consequences in return from the risks they face."
}
